build/
pdks/
*.vcd
*.vvp
*.json
# ...but test fixtures are source, not a local config someone left behind.
!tests/fixtures/*.json
# ...and so is release-please's own configuration. Without these two the action
# falls back to its defaults and computes a different version from a manifest
# that is not there.
!release-please-config.json
!.release-please-manifest.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
